          "memories": [
            {
              "content": "The user keeps gloves and scarves in a basket inside the entrance.",
              "content_digest": "df54c52cb6bc89e2e66c747df9807c6892db272c2a23ac5ac91e3f64aaa2a5da",
              "position": 0,
              "uid": "4eca74d0-4413-5339-a8fa-6b6fa3515409"
            },
            {
              "content": "On a day the user could not find their gloves, they walked with their hands in their pockets and missed the bus.",
              "content_digest": "d4205aee5fe3f2c18adc3622930cc7f74de231de9812ca594dbd95a0af7199ff",
              "position": 1,
              "uid": "22632e75-6b0f-58f3-ad9c-20b253d4d4e5"
            },
            {
              "content": "Before the next outing, the user put the gloves in the entrance basket the night before and left on time.",
              "content_digest": "23a7026d7d1a7edd3278e7b8aa147ef0d315059663f78da5498ad6c1b4a5407c",
              "position": 2,
              "uid": "a11f0943-8ee1-5305-87fb-64982fb36f82"
            },
            {
              "content": "On a snowy day, the user chose a shorter route but turned back at stairs that had not been cleared of snow.",
              "content_digest": "e9e241d2bc4d7c2fa9a44471aa6d1c16d42d50fe2ed99ccfb50713107714be9b",
              "position": 3,
              "uid": "f623f245-cdd5-5080-8869-b52cf2914076"
            },
            {
              "content": "The next day, the user took a cleared sidewalk along the main road and avoided slippery sections.",
              "content_digest": "62c8ec8b38778e9922cf433af4ceb4d59f60bee52dc758e3b88bb1163637f108",
              "position": 4,
              "uid": "17ac56f1-1302-5350-99d5-b95ef7feb768"
            },
            {
              "content": "The user fell asleep with the heat turned up, became too warm before dawn, and woke twice.",
              "content_digest": "912dbbc88a0f4a174b714a794793781f4d2f6c889f73cd7f825338addcab5d6c",
              "position": 5,
              "uid": "96988fa9-44b1-511e-8c99-4372f902cfe3"
            },
            {
              "content": "The next night, the user turned down the heat and used one additional thin blanket.",
              "content_digest": "3d12a4609d4731ebe71bacc841c979ac3497553238c3b5c2191842bbf075ba89",
              "position": 6,
              "uid": "b628acaa-50da-552c-8665-244dc4ab8263"
            },
            {
              "content": "On a morning with heavy snow, the user's father expects the user will worry about road conditions and sends a text before departure.",
              "content_digest": "dcd6bcb23bee46e49813bb14dd8dcb91983d5830f0536d7f23fcdb3a8af0667c",
              "position": 7,
              "uid": "08dfb937-7b28-55b5-801c-c0da00cbd414"
            },
            {
              "content": "Before proposing a winter travel route, check recent snow-clearing conditions and accessible entrances.",
              "content_digest": "dcab87102a9979c51dd369d5ba5ed00b7445c8ccd14450edcb8bec7859689606",
              "position": 8,
              "uid": "be55eacc-6c19-5ced-8b25-bc1fac07ba5d"
            },
            {
              "content": "The local agent cannot know the actual condition of the sidewalk the user will take from a weather forecast alone.",
              "content_digest": "6b4bcc2f2f508f130c047ff677cadae0eae5b4cc5e5dd6bb3a1fb3784d7793b1",
              "position": 9,
              "uid": "802c4031-57de-592a-9bc8-6ee3d54921c8"
            }
          ],
